1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,240
(Amy:)How does one miss that?

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,630
(Leonard:)This is ridiculous.

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,160
(Leonard:)You're just making stuff up.

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,480
(Amy:)Is he always like
this when he loses?

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,900
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes.

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:14,740
(Sheldon:)You should've been here for the
great Jenga tantrum of 2008.

7
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,790
(Leonard:)You bumped the table
and you know it.

8
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,810
(Amy:)Perhaps it would be
kinder to play a game

9
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,850
(Amy:)more suited to his abilities.

10
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:30,650
(Amy:)We'll close our eyes and
count to ten while you hide.

11
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:33,320
(Leonard:)I'm going to my room.

12
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,570
(Amy:)Very good, Leonard.

13
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,740
(Amy:)But next time, don't tell
us where you're hiding.

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,330
♪ Our whole universe was
in a hot, dense state ♪

